---
<section id="software" class="py-24 bg-brand-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-blue font-semibold text-xs mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Herramientas & Open Source
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4">Software</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-blue/70 leading-relaxed">
          Nuestra suite de herramientas y playgrounds está actualmente <strong class="text-brand-blue font-bold">en construcción 🚧</strong>. 
          Creemos firmemente en el poder de la comunidad, por lo que gran parte de nuestros desarrollos internos y librerías son de código abierto (Open Source).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-brand-blue rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-16 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center text-center animate-scale-in">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-teal/20 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-green/10 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-brand-cream/10 border border-brand-cream/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cream mx-auto mb-8 shadow-inner backdrop-blur-sm">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
